WEBVTT

00:07.750 --> 00:10.040
Weird that she asked me to meet up here...

00:11.460 --> 00:14.170
Wait, a new student? For me?!

00:14.790 --> 00:17.920
I wonder what's up with her...

00:18.210 --> 00:20.540
OMG, are you my tutor?

00:23.250 --> 00:26.080
Hiii! It's me!

00:26.710 --> 00:27.580
A gyaru?!

00:28.130 --> 00:30.460
Sorry I'm late!

00:33.040 --> 00:35.040
What did she even trip over?!

00:35.040 --> 00:36.880
Hey, are you okay?!

00:39.880 --> 00:44.250
My gum's in my hair! Aw, man!

00:46.460 --> 00:48.880
But that won't ruin my day!

00:50.210 --> 00:54.580
So, whatcha thinking?
Gotta be the cutest student ever, right?

00:54.960 --> 00:56.540
C'mon, tell me!

00:56.540 --> 00:58.380
Um, uh...

01:00.130 --> 01:01.380
Are those contacts?

01:02.130 --> 01:04.540
What a crazy design...

01:05.540 --> 01:08.380
I mean, you definitely have a sense for fashion.

01:08.380 --> 01:11.630
Like, totally! So glad you get it, Sensei.

01:12.580 --> 01:16.710
I've never interacted with someone like her...
Like, this eyeshadow is one I just bought,<b></b>

01:14.080 --> 01:16.500
<b>AHAHAHAHA!</b>

01:16.710 --> 01:20.750
it literally just came out! Isn't it awesome?

01:17.420 --> 01:20.750
I dunno if I'll be able to handle her...

01:22.420 --> 01:30.290
While we walk the world of the living,
the dead drift through the spirit world.

01:31.420 --> 01:38.080
These two worlds sometimes intersect,
allowing evil spirits to do harm to the living.

01:38.750 --> 01:46.540
This young girl is gathering dark power
to slay the spirit who took her loved one.

01:47.080 --> 01:52.250
The grudges of the dead,
used to pursue a grudge far greater...

03:26.420 --> 03:29.540
So why are we studying here?
Kind of kills the point of me being a HOME tutor...

03:29.540 --> 03:31.460
It's like, hard to focus at home.

03:31.710 --> 03:34.000
Also, I need sugar to focus.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.540
O-okay...

03:36.080 --> 03:38.420
L-let's get started, then.

03:39.170 --> 03:42.040
I'm Keitaro Gentoga, your tutor from Square.

03:43.080 --> 03:44.000
Pleased to meet you.

03:44.880 --> 03:47.580
I'm Ai Kamiyo, first-year high schooler!

03:47.790 --> 03:50.460
Feel free to call me Ai, Keitaro-sensei!

03:50.460 --> 03:53.040
Not even "Gentoga"!
She's already putting us on a first-name basis!

03:53.500 --> 03:56.420
You got it, Ai-chan...

03:56.580 --> 03:57.750
Yep, thanks!

03:58.500 --> 04:02.460
Damn, those mini donuts you got look super good.

04:02.460 --> 04:03.500
She's after them!

04:03.960 --> 04:06.130
But I can make this work!

04:06.420 --> 04:07.540
Want some?

04:07.540 --> 04:08.920
Wait, for real?!

04:08.920 --> 04:12.130
Yep, but let's make a little game out of it.

04:12.290 --> 04:13.250
A game?

04:13.670 --> 04:19.380
For every question you get right on this sheet,
I'll give you one donut.

04:13.790 --> 04:15.170
<b>Japanese Language</b>

04:13.790 --> 04:15.170
<b>Review Questions</b>

04:19.790 --> 04:22.130
But if you get a question wrong, I'll eat the donut instead.

04:23.670 --> 04:30.130
If you end up eating more than me,
I'll pay for your order. How's that sound?

04:30.380 --> 04:32.790
Hell yeah! Let's go!

04:32.790 --> 04:34.460
Not off to a great start...

04:35.170 --> 04:39.170
But turning studying into a game
is definitely gonna work for her!

04:39.750 --> 04:42.080
I knew she wouldn't be the type
who could just sit and study!

04:42.380 --> 04:45.790
Not that that's bad or anything, I just had a feeling!

04:47.170 --> 04:48.920
Okay, let's get started!

04:48.920 --> 04:50.040
Come on!

04:50.380 --> 04:52.630
<b>Complete the following idioms:</b>

04:50.380 --> 04:52.630
<b>1. ( Fashion ) favors the bold</b>

04:50.380 --> 04:52.630
<b>2. (      ) is bliss</b>

04:50.380 --> 04:52.630
<b>3. The best thing since (             )</b>

04:50.460 --> 04:51.330
Question one!

04:55.000 --> 04:55.960
Question two!

04:55.080 --> 04:56.880
<b>Complete the following idioms:</b>

04:55.080 --> 04:56.880
<b>1. ( Fashion ) favors the bold</b>

04:55.080 --> 04:56.880
<b>3. The best thing since (             )</b>

04:55.090 --> 04:56.880
<b>2. ( Sleep ) is bliss</b>

04:58.670 --> 05:00.380
<b>Complete the following idioms:</b>

04:58.670 --> 05:00.380
<b>1. ( Fashion ) favors the bold</b>

04:58.670 --> 05:00.380
<b>2. ( Sleep ) is bliss</b>

04:58.670 --> 05:00.380
<b>3. The best thing since ( smartphones )</b>

04:58.750 --> 04:59.580
Question three!

05:05.630 --> 05:07.420
Those were great...

05:07.710 --> 05:12.170
I'm so full... Definitely spoiled my dinner.

05:12.170 --> 05:16.580
Don't rub it in! You suck, Sensei!

05:16.580 --> 05:21.250
Now I get why she wanted
one-on-one tutoring. She's in big trouble.

05:21.250 --> 05:26.040
Ugh, I need something to make me
feel better! I'm getting a parfait!

05:26.040 --> 05:27.380
Hey, don't be rude!

05:27.750 --> 05:30.000
Yes, I'll be right there!

05:35.960 --> 05:39.040
I-I am so sorry, miss!

05:40.670 --> 05:43.580
How do I have the worst luck?!

05:43.880 --> 05:46.170
How does my day just keep getting worse?!

05:47.210 --> 05:48.040
Ai-chan...

05:48.420 --> 05:54.000
Th-this is gonna sound weird, but have you been dealing
with sleep paralysis or sore shoulders?

05:55.790 --> 05:57.380
Wait, how'd you know?

05:59.790 --> 06:00.790
Look...

06:04.710 --> 06:07.420
Since the moment we met, I've sensed something off...

06:08.290 --> 06:10.960
It didn't feel wrong, so I didn't say anything.

06:12.040 --> 06:15.330
W-wait, can you see ghosts?!

06:16.210 --> 06:18.130
Please, you gotta help me!

06:18.130 --> 06:23.250
Huh?! I can just sense them,
I'm not an exorcist or anything!

06:23.250 --> 06:25.290
What...?

06:25.630 --> 06:27.500
Could you tell me what's going on, though?

06:28.540 --> 06:29.330
So...

06:29.750 --> 06:31.250
I'm really unlucky.

06:31.670 --> 06:34.500
Like, ghosts are always coming after me,
for as long as I can remember.

06:34.750 --> 06:38.580
They've never like, possessed me,
but they make bad stuff happen to me.

06:38.830 --> 06:41.580
Me and everyone who hangs around me, too.

06:42.670 --> 06:44.790
You know how I tripped and fell earlier?

06:45.080 --> 06:48.330
I felt something grab my ankle.

06:50.380 --> 06:51.420
That's nothing, though.

06:51.750 --> 06:56.500
I had an older brother once. We were really close.

06:58.250 --> 06:59.130
Is that right?

06:59.130 --> 07:00.830
C'mon, Big Bro!

07:02.420 --> 07:03.960
And something bad...

07:10.460 --> 07:13.960
...happened to him, too.

07:15.830 --> 07:17.380
Big... brother!

07:17.790 --> 07:19.000
Don't cry...

07:20.250 --> 07:22.750
You're prettier when you smile.

07:23.250 --> 07:25.130
I'm so proud of you.

07:26.080 --> 07:32.580
Seeing you like that makes me sad. I can't die like that...

07:34.420 --> 07:37.920
I think the spirit you sense is my brother.

07:37.920 --> 07:41.000
He's keeping me safe from bad ghosts.

07:41.380 --> 07:44.830
But because of that, he can't rest in peace.

07:46.040 --> 07:47.830
Ugh, c'mon, me!

07:48.130 --> 07:53.960
I'm scared of ghosts, but I pretend everything's
A-OK to scare them off,

07:54.130 --> 07:57.540
and hopefully make my brother stop
worrying about me so he can go to Heaven!

07:59.380 --> 08:06.040
I mean, the whole reason I hired you was
so I could get better grades and show him I'm okay.

08:06.250 --> 08:07.290
Ai-chan...

08:11.000 --> 08:14.880
If you're up for it, I might know
someone who can help you.

08:16.630 --> 08:25.080
So, this is Yayoi Hozuki,
my first student and an extremely talented exorcist.

08:25.420 --> 08:29.500
Uh-huh... But she's a little kid. You sure?

08:29.920 --> 08:35.250
And this is Ai Kamiyo. She's got a ghost problem.

08:35.250 --> 08:36.250
Welcome.

08:36.540 --> 08:41.130
To sum everything up, you wanna be like this, yeah?

08:38.250 --> 08:39.830
<b>Defenseless</b>

08:38.250 --> 08:39.830
<b>Protect</b>

08:38.250 --> 08:39.830
<b>Brother can't rest</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:41.290
<b>Empowered</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:41.290
<b>At peace</b>

08:40.090 --> 08:41.290
<b>Brother: can rest</b>

08:41.130 --> 08:45.630
Yeah, that's it! You catch on fast! Good Job!

08:45.630 --> 08:46.790
Yay.

08:47.580 --> 08:54.880
Seriously, this diagram makes it mega easy to understand!
And you made me look hella cute!

08:49.880 --> 08:53.670
Bringing her to me was good thinking.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.830
I can see you're being followed...

09:02.080 --> 09:03.130
...by two spirits.

09:07.420 --> 09:08.540
There we go.

09:09.040 --> 09:10.670
What's this for?

09:10.670 --> 09:13.750
A ritual. It's a relatively simple way to trap a spirit.

09:14.000 --> 09:19.040
I use it a lot to relocate wandering ghosts.

09:19.500 --> 09:21.380
It's already working.

09:22.670 --> 09:23.750
Caught it.

09:24.290 --> 09:26.460
Wait, you caught it?

09:26.460 --> 09:28.460
So, like... It's all taken care of?

09:28.460 --> 09:30.330
L-looks like it.

09:30.330 --> 09:32.750
You're not just a little kid, huh...?

09:33.420 --> 09:35.170
My first student.

09:35.790 --> 09:37.750
That makes her my senpai...

09:38.710 --> 09:41.380
Thanks, Little Senpai!

09:42.000 --> 09:43.210
Wait, what?!

09:43.210 --> 09:45.580
Cause she's little and my senpai!

09:46.630 --> 09:49.130
If another spirit bothers you, just come to me.

09:49.380 --> 09:50.420
Thanks!

09:50.790 --> 09:55.880
I get dragged into loads of spooky situations,
so I definitely will!

09:55.880 --> 09:59.040
And now your brother can be at peace.

09:59.040 --> 09:59.630
Yeah!

09:59.630 --> 10:00.540
Just in case.

10:01.130 --> 10:03.420
Ow! What the hell?!

10:03.420 --> 10:07.130
Um, uh, it'll keep you safe, Ai-chan!

10:07.130 --> 10:09.170
Hey, let me walk you partway, yeah?

10:10.960 --> 10:12.880
See you later, Yayoi-chan!

10:14.250 --> 10:15.960
Okay, let's go.

10:16.290 --> 10:16.960
Mm-hmm.

10:31.880 --> 10:34.880
Okay. This one should be strong enough.

10:45.420 --> 10:47.670
Huh? Where am I...?

10:53.790 --> 10:54.960
A spirit?

10:55.920 --> 10:58.170
Please, protect Ai.

10:59.710 --> 11:02.080
I cannot protect her here.

11:03.380 --> 11:05.420
If not protected, she will die.

11:07.750 --> 11:10.080
I am not a threat.

11:10.960 --> 11:12.250
Her brother is.

11:13.670 --> 11:16.000
Wh-what are you?

11:17.080 --> 11:20.540
I am Ai's-

11:23.420 --> 11:24.670
<b>YAYOI-CHAN</b>

11:23.580 --> 11:24.580
Yayoi-chan?!

11:25.670 --> 11:26.630
Hello?

11:26.630 --> 11:28.040
Hello, Keitaro?

11:28.580 --> 11:29.830
Ai is in trouble.

11:31.170 --> 11:35.500
The doll I put her hair into is getting its neck strangled.

11:40.710 --> 11:44.210
What if we're heading into another dangerous situation?!

11:44.210 --> 11:45.290
We'll be fine.

11:45.290 --> 11:49.210
This one's protecting you, Eiko, and me.

11:52.130 --> 11:55.040
Ai-chan lives here alone from what I know.

11:55.420 --> 11:57.000
The door's probably locked right now.

11:57.710 --> 12:02.170
Wait, sixteen and living alone?
What's going on with her family?

12:02.330 --> 12:03.540
What apartment is she?

12:03.670 --> 12:04.830
301.

12:05.040 --> 12:05.670
What?

12:16.750 --> 12:17.750
I can't move.

12:18.170 --> 12:20.420
More sleep paralysis?

12:27.920 --> 12:29.330
My brother?!

12:34.080 --> 12:35.380
Why?

12:40.210 --> 12:45.880
The doll's taking damage.
Ai should be unharmed... if we can make it in time!

12:48.420 --> 12:49.250
There.

12:55.130 --> 12:57.500
Wh-why...?

12:57.960 --> 12:59.500
Why...?

13:02.380 --> 13:04.250
You're my brother...!

13:06.710 --> 13:07.500
Ai!

13:07.880 --> 13:09.170
Little Senpai?!

13:21.540 --> 13:23.790
<b>49 days after his death</b>

13:21.540 --> 13:23.790
<b>Memorial Service</b>

13:25.460 --> 13:26.710
He's ascending.

13:27.920 --> 13:30.500
Why'd you attack her?

13:31.540 --> 13:39.540
To spare her... Her fate...

13:45.960 --> 13:49.210
Why would my brother do that?

13:56.250 --> 13:59.250
I'm sorry! Please, stay with me!

14:03.710 --> 14:04.580
Here.

14:05.460 --> 14:07.750
Take a minute to catch your breath.

14:08.080 --> 14:08.790
Okay...

14:11.960 --> 14:17.330
So... So my brother hated me all this time.

14:18.710 --> 14:22.710
Because I was the reason he died.

14:26.210 --> 14:31.960
I didn't sense anything evil about him.
He must have done that for a reason.

14:32.580 --> 14:34.580
A reason? What reason?

14:35.040 --> 14:38.460
I can't say, but I'm not just saying it
to make you feel better.

14:44.540 --> 14:45.920
Then I wanna know.

14:46.540 --> 14:50.460
I wanna know why my brother tried to take me with him.

14:51.540 --> 14:55.040
Especially when I'm gonna die in four years, anyway.

14:57.960 --> 15:00.130
Ai-chan, what does that mean?

15:01.290 --> 15:02.880
Oh, right.

15:03.170 --> 15:13.170
So, apparently, a god fell in love with me,
and when I turn twenty, it's gonna take me away.

15:14.460 --> 15:17.630
Apparently, that just happens with my family.

15:18.040 --> 15:20.880
So why would he try to kill me?

15:20.880 --> 15:24.540
I'm trying so hard to live my best life while I can!

15:33.580 --> 15:34.750
Wait a sec...

15:35.630 --> 15:37.330
That's the spirit I saw when I was asleep!

15:42.380 --> 15:46.380
<b>Yayoi</b>

15:46.630 --> 15:50.000
Ai-chan, why do you have that creepy photo framed?

15:50.000 --> 15:54.170
Wait, what? There's something creepy in it?! Where?!

15:55.920 --> 15:57.790
What do you mean, where?! It's right there!

15:57.790 --> 16:05.130
Ugh, this is the nicest picture I have of us, too!
I can't believe it's in there!

16:07.170 --> 16:12.790
Keitaro, some haunted photos can only be seen
by those with strong spiritual sense.

16:13.750 --> 16:15.040
This has to be one of them.

16:15.540 --> 16:19.880
I didn't even see it until I focused harder.

16:20.460 --> 16:23.920
Keitaro must've been able to see it
because of his ties to his family's shrine.

16:24.830 --> 16:27.130
This is the one we caught earlier today.

16:28.710 --> 16:34.750
So if the stars disappeared from
her eyes after we caught it...

16:41.710 --> 16:44.580
What a fascinating conclusion you've made.

16:45.880 --> 16:48.170
Thank you for protecting Ai.

16:48.750 --> 16:52.170
This was a bit of trouble, yes, but it's all right now.

16:52.250 --> 16:59.250
As ever, I will drive away anything
that may harm my property.

16:59.540 --> 17:03.130
What's up, Sensei? You're freaking me out.

17:03.130 --> 17:04.960
Oh, uh... n-nothing.

17:05.540 --> 17:08.040
I thought those were contacts.

17:10.710 --> 17:11.670
They're a brand.

17:30.790 --> 17:32.460
See you in four years...

17:34.000 --> 17:36.210
when you're all mine.

17:37.040 --> 17:40.330
Keitaro, Ai's most likely telling the truth.

17:41.130 --> 17:44.130
If the stars are back in her eyes,

17:44.750 --> 17:49.210
then the one we caught has fought
everyone in my room and broken out.

17:50.670 --> 17:52.670
Wait, so the thing we caught...

17:52.670 --> 17:55.710
...is a spirit with overwhelming power: a God.

17:56.500 --> 17:57.830
She's not lying.

17:58.000 --> 17:58.920
Ai is...

17:59.500 --> 18:01.460
betrothed to divinity.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.500
A blackout?

18:12.040 --> 18:13.040
Yayoi-chan...

18:13.750 --> 18:18.380
Yeah. Spirits are coming for her.

18:18.380 --> 18:19.210
Huh?!

18:19.920 --> 18:25.500
The god Ai's betrothed to
is leaking its energy from Ai herself.

18:26.250 --> 18:28.960
That's probably what's luring in these spirits.

18:29.580 --> 18:33.830
Right now, it's just harmless wandering ghosts,
but it's about to get a whole lot more crowded...

18:35.210 --> 18:39.790
OHMIGOD, stop! Can you like,
not freak me out right now?!

18:39.790 --> 18:41.210
She's so normal!

18:42.250 --> 18:46.000
How long has it been since I've seen someone
have a normal reaction to this stuff?!

18:46.670 --> 18:48.170
Okay, focus!

18:48.380 --> 18:51.540
A..Ai-chan, how long have you lived here?

18:51.540 --> 18:52.920
Has anything ever hurt you?

18:53.170 --> 18:57.250
Nope, and I've lived here for two-ish months.

18:58.290 --> 19:00.540
Are you sensitive to spiritual activity?

19:00.670 --> 19:01.710
I dunno.

19:02.130 --> 19:06.040
My brother's the first ghost I've actually seen.

19:06.040 --> 19:09.460
Sometimes my shoulders get stiff,
or I get mad sleep paralysis.

19:09.460 --> 19:14.790
So how was she fine in this room
full of wandering ghosts?

19:14.790 --> 19:16.000
Pause on that, Keitaro.

19:16.830 --> 19:20.960
We need to get everyone out of here.
I'll have Eiko come pick us up.

19:20.960 --> 19:24.130
What?! But it's one in the morning!

19:24.130 --> 19:26.500
Don't worry. Eiko'll be here.

19:26.500 --> 19:27.790
Who's Eiko?

19:28.750 --> 19:29.880
You'll see.

19:30.630 --> 19:33.080
<b>EIKO</b>

19:30.630 --> 19:33.080
<b>Keitaro</b>

19:30.630 --> 19:33.080
<b>is alone with a girl</b>

19:30.630 --> 19:33.080
<b>come here!</b>

19:30.920 --> 19:33.000
Wait, hold on, don't give her the wrong idea!

19:34.500 --> 19:37.670
Kei-kun's chastity is in trouble?!

19:37.670 --> 19:39.040
How are you here already?!

19:41.290 --> 19:43.460
This is Eiko. She's my cousin.

19:43.460 --> 19:45.170
H-hello!

19:45.170 --> 19:46.290
Uh-huh...

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>TELL HER</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>I'M YOUR</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>GIRLFRIEND</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>TELL HER</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>I'M YOUR</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>GIRLFRIEND</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>TELL HER</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>I'M YOUR</b>

19:47.670 --> 19:49.380
<b>GIRLFRIEND</b>

19:50.000 --> 19:50.790
And...

19:51.000 --> 19:53.380
A-and she's my girlfriend.

19:54.040 --> 19:57.420
Wait, she's your girlfriend? This isn't, like, a trick, right?

19:57.420 --> 20:00.630
You seriously think it's that impossible for me
to get a girlfriend?

20:02.710 --> 20:04.290
Th-thanks for coming.

20:04.290 --> 20:05.960
S-sure, no problem.

20:06.420 --> 20:10.420
She's cute, though! Way to go, Sensei.

20:10.420 --> 20:14.750
Wait, she's being nice to me?
Did I totally get the wrong idea about her?

20:15.540 --> 20:18.540
This is Ai Kamiyo, my newest student.

20:18.540 --> 20:19.170
Huh?

20:19.290 --> 20:22.420
And how did you know where we were, Eiko?

20:22.500 --> 20:23.380
Gulp!

20:23.630 --> 20:27.000
I should've told you to wait in the parking lot.

20:27.580 --> 20:31.380
I shouldn't have called you
up to this supernatural nest of an apartment.

20:32.000 --> 20:33.750
Yeah, I should've thought of that, too.

20:34.830 --> 20:36.880
Nicely dodged.

20:36.880 --> 20:37.790
Easy peasy.

20:38.710 --> 20:42.170
So wait, what kind of supernatural nest
are we talking about?

20:42.830 --> 20:46.920
A lot of spirits are gathering in this apartment.
It's not safe to stay here.

20:49.130 --> 20:53.380
After we head out, I'll need to grab something
that'll help me get this place back to normal.

20:53.790 --> 20:56.170
We've gotta be delicate here.

20:57.460 --> 20:59.920
<b>Yayoi-chan</b>

20:57.460 --> 20:59.920
<b>Ai's brother just went to RIP</b>

20:57.460 --> 20:59.920
<b>but he attacked her before that</b>

20:57.460 --> 20:59.920
<b>not sure why yet</b>

20:57.460 --> 20:59.920
<b>she's still freaked out</b>

20:57.460 --> 20:59.920
<b>feeling better now but don't wanna leave her alone</b>

21:00.960 --> 21:04.000
Could you drive us home, Eiko?

21:04.000 --> 21:05.790
Yep! You got it!

21:06.460 --> 21:10.710
You can sleep over with us, Ai-chan.
I'll bake us something fun!

21:10.790 --> 21:11.580
Huh?

21:11.580 --> 21:14.380
What do you like to eat? I take requests!

21:14.790 --> 21:17.500
I love anything with chocolate!

21:17.500 --> 21:20.920
Okay, we could do a chocolate cake, or some brownies!

21:20.920 --> 21:22.250
For real?!

21:22.250 --> 21:23.210
Wait a sec.

21:24.580 --> 21:28.420
There's a reason you don't eat dessert at night...

21:32.000 --> 21:34.210
I'm gonna use the bathroom before we go.

21:34.210 --> 21:38.330
Do it fast, Keitaro, before the bigger baddies show up.

21:47.130 --> 21:48.210
I think...

21:49.500 --> 21:50.670
...they're already here!

23:22.580 --> 23:30.830
Ai is betrothed to a god,
whose energy is drawing in evil spirits.

23:32.380 --> 23:39.540
When they become trapped in an enclosed space,
something vile approaches...
